<title>USA: TRW Q3 diluted shr rises to $1.60.</title>
<headline>TRW Q3 diluted shr rises to $1.60.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.60		    $1.41</p>
<p> Net		 105,200		  93,600</p>
<p> Sales	     2,320,500		2,249,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  66,200		   66,700</p>
<p>	  Nine months ended Sept.30</p>
<p> Shr		 $5.27		    $4.94</p>
<p> Net		 352,700		  331,400</p>
<p> Sales	     7,406,000		7,257,700</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  67,000		   67,200</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: Excluding special items and the operating results of the company's information services business, which was sold September 19, earnings for the third quarter increased 10 percent to $86.2 million, or $1.31 per fully diluted share, from $78.2 million, or $1.18 per fully diluted share, in the year-earlier quarter. Special items in the third quarter include an after-tax gain of $242.4 million, or $3.67 per fully diluted share, from the sale of the company's information services business.</p>
</text>
